  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "original_book_a",
      "hash64": "24E341B1229F3332",
      "text": "有一本叫做《朱之書》的\\n緋紅色書本。\\r\\n……要讀讀看嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "original_book_b",
      "hash64": "24E340B1229F317F",
      "text": "有一本叫做《紫之書》的\\n紫色書本。\\r\\n……要讀讀看嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "original_book_common",
      "hash64": "9E1370AA866F477E",
      "text": "要讀哪個部分呢……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "original_book_title_01_01",
      "hash64": "D7551BB7473956E7",
      "text": "財寶傳說",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_01_01",
      "hash64": "B925A92771F05355",
      "text": "自從下到巨穴那刻起，\\n究竟過了多少時日呢？\\n走過漫漫長長的路途，\\n我們到達了巨坑的最深處。\\n那裡是一座洞窟，\\n放眼望去皆是光彩奪目的寶石。\\n那道耀眼到令人幾乎\\n睜不開眼的神秘光芒，\\n是否就是保護財寶的守護者呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "original_book_title_02_01_A",
      "hash64": "99AB89BAE58B9534",
      "text": "第零區的怪物",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_02_01_A",
      "hash64": "1783D0F9A7A79672",
      "text": "在第零區內棲息著\\n不可思議的寶可夢。\\n當我們下到越深處，\\n連是不是寶可夢都\\n無從得知的巨大凶暴生物\\n開始露出了牠們的身影。\\n在牠們猛烈攻擊下，\\n有隊員受到了致命傷，\\n使我們決定暫時撤退。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "original_book_title_02_02_A",
      "hash64": "B3D790BAF46C00D9",
      "text": "第零區的怪物",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_02_02_A",
      "hash64": "0CCEFBF9A102F483",
      "text": "觀測隊的其中一名隊員\\n偶然拍攝到的相片。\\n雖然看似是叫做頓甲的寶可夢，\\n但就身體大小和背部形狀\\n等特徵來看，\\n應是全然不同的生物。\\n這牙可真是雄偉啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "original_book_title_02_01_B",
      "hash64": "99AB8CBAE58B9A4D",
      "text": "第零區的怪物",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_02_01_B",
      "hash64": "1783CFF9A7A794BF",
      "text": "在第零區內棲息著\\n不可思議的寶可夢。\\n當我們下到越深處，\\n連是不是寶可夢都\\n無從得知的小型殘酷生物\\n開始露出了牠們的身影。\\n在牠們猛烈攻擊下，\\n有隊員受到了致命傷，\\n使我們決定暫時撤退。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "original_book_title_02_02_B",
      "hash64": "B3D78DBAF46BFBC0",
      "text": "第零區的怪物",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_02_02_B",
      "hash64": "0CCEFCF9A102F636",
      "text": "觀測隊的其中一名隊員\\n偶然拍攝到的相片。\\n雖然看似叫做頓甲的寶可夢，\\n但就身體質感和行動方式\\n等特徵來看，\\n應是全然不同的生物。\\n那簡直就猶如鐵之轍跡一般。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "original_book_title_03_01",
      "hash64": "AFC54FC7B9210EC5",
      "text": "帕底亞巨坑",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_03_01",
      "hash64": "E2687517017A2FF7",
      "text": "由觀測隊於進入巨坑的地點拍攝。\\n很幸運地當天天氣狀況良好，\\n使觀測隊得以順利出發。\\n從相片裡的巨坑\\n雖然能下到很深的地方去，\\n但由於下層有雲生成的關係，\\n導致觀測隊無法對傳出\\n財寶傳說的最深處進行確認。\\n接下來將往巨坑的下方移動。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "original_book_title_04_01",
      "hash64": "062B17CF548ACBCE",
      "text": "第零區全景圖",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_04_01",
      "hash64": "125A6540B94172FC",
      "text": "在第零區的內部\\n沿著周圍螺旋狀的崖壁走，\\n便能往下移動。\\n那裡還有植物和水源。\\n自古以來便有傳聞指出\\n第零區的最深處沉睡著\\n傳說的樹果及貴重的礦石等財寶，\\n並且還傳說有守護者\\n一直在守護著那些財寶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "original_book_title_05_01",
      "hash64": "337803D5B7097123",
      "text": "作者簡介",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_05_01_A",
      "hash64": "F2A5EA08E5C7BC71",
      "text": "本書《朱之書》的作者，海哲。\\n照片是與搭檔摩托蜥的合影。\\n是位作家，也是博物學的研究者。\\n因被選為第零區觀測隊隊員，\\n而前往帕底亞巨坑探索，\\n並於歸來後撰寫本書。\\n在第零區觀測時，\\n摩托蜥擔任搬運行李的職務，\\n表現得非常亮眼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_05_01_B",
      "hash64": "F2A5E708E5C7B758",
      "text": "本書《紫之書》的作者，海哲。\\n照片是與搭檔摩托蜥的合影。\\n是位作家，也是博物學的研究者。\\n因被選為第零區觀測隊隊員，\\n而前往帕底亞巨坑探索，\\n並於歸來後撰寫本書。\\n在第零區觀測時，\\n摩托蜥擔任搬運行李的職務，\\n表現得非常亮眼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "original_book_title_06_01",
      "hash64": "08FA0BE100722E6C",
      "text": "第零區的冒險",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_06_01",
      "hash64": "905AB132BCCAA51E",
      "text": "帕底亞巨坑內部\\n連綿著不可思議的世界，\\n人們稱那裡為第零區。\\n未曾見過的地形。\\n未曾見過的植物。\\n未曾見過的寶可夢。\\n在那片不適合人類生活的\\n土地上，應該沉睡著什麼\\n不為人知的東西吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "original_book_title_06_02",
      "hash64": "08FA0EE100723385",
      "text": "第零區的冒險",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_06_02",
      "hash64": "905AB032BCCAA36B",
      "text": "調查開始第二天。照片由\\n觀測隊隊員於休息時所拍攝。\\n請關注照片裡的地面，\\n有神秘的符號被畫在上面。\\n是帝國時代前來\\n探索寶藏的人畫的嗎？\\n還是一開始就存在的呢……\\n那看起來就像是\\n含有某種意義的圖形。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "original_book_title_07_01",
      "hash64": "0AA257E627DC9CC1",
      "text": "棲息於第零區的寶可夢",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_07_01",
      "hash64": "E6535D3A57D760B3",
      "text": "觀測隊隊員所畫的素描。\\n\\n意外地，第零區上層部分的\\n寶可夢種類與巨坑外的\\n似乎沒有太大差異。\\n\\n到達下層部分後，\\n有時會聽到我們以前\\n從未聽過的叫聲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "original_book_title_08_01_A",
      "hash64": "6B67B7C5720573CA",
      "text": "本書的贊助者",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_08_01_A",
      "hash64": "D309EB492B6A9DEC",
      "text": "學院校長與作者海哲。\\n觀測第零區的所需資金\\n由橘子學院出資。\\n我們將共享在第零區\\n收集到的資料給學院\\n用於研究事業的發展。\\n但願學院能藉其蒸蒸日上，\\n培育出下一代的研究者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "original_book_title_08_01_B",
      "hash64": "6B67B6C572057217",
      "text": "本書的贊助者",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_08_01_B",
      "hash64": "D309EE492B6AA305",
      "text": "學院校長與作者海哲。\\n觀測第零區的所需資金\\n由葡萄學院出資。\\n我們將共享在第零區\\n收集到的資料給學院\\n用於研究事業的發展。\\n但願學院能藉其蒸蒸日上，\\n培育出下一代的研究者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "original_book_title_09_01",
      "hash64": "37D00BF90DC3AA1F",
      "text": "神秘板子",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_09_01",
      "hash64": "43FF796A727A87AD",
      "text": "在往第零區下方移動的途中，\\n發現了畫著神秘符號的\\n板子被掩埋著。\\n該板子以現今科學無法判別的\\n特殊金屬素材所製成，\\n即使去刨削它也是絲毫無損。\\n這些記號是為了什麼被畫下，\\n是如何被畫上去的，全都是謎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "original_book_title_10_01",
      "hash64": "7259AFE0E9E44635",
      "text": "秘傳調味料",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_10_01",
      "hash64": "2803FD5736999863",
      "text": "觀測隊在第零區發現了食用後\\n會立即變得精力充沛的神秘植物，\\n我們將其命名為秘傳調味料。\\n作為嘗試，我們將該種植物\\n帶出巨坑，在帕底亞各地培育。\\n然而周遭的寶可夢卻吃掉了\\n尚未成長完全的調味料，\\n並變得巨大又強悍。\\n我們將其稱為寶主寶可夢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "original_book_title_11_01",
      "hash64": "1AAD63D94D64E640",
      "text": "[EMPTY 65]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
