    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "original_book_title_15_01",
      "hash64": "204BEBFCA534BB5C",
      "text": "圓盤的寶可夢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_15_01",
      "hash64": "F6CB892D7DBCB272",
      "text": "和觀測隊的隊員們走散時，\\n我似乎在巨坑的最深處，\\n發現了不可思議的物體。\\n那是不是寶可夢，算不算生物\\n皆無從得知，是種謎樣的存在。\\n他的外殼由多層六角形重疊構成，\\n發出的光比寶石還來得耀眼。\\n那形狀，就如同圓盤一般。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "original_book_title_16_01",
      "hash64": "4AC9E3F15BCBFE13",
      "text": "圓盤的寶可夢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_16_01",
      "hash64": "FAD6494450B28B05",
      "text": "我暫時將這種生物\\n稱為太樂巴戈斯。\\n我推測促使寶可夢閃耀發光\\n並結晶化的物質\\n正是牠的身體。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
